  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "Crash Party scoreboard. CREATED at the cp_board_wp waypoint when the master switch is thrown and destroyed when it is thrown off - deliberately NOT a permanent placement, so the Well of Eru looks normal when no party is on. Move the waypoint to move the board, and ROTATE the waypoint to turn it - the board is created facing the way the waypoint points. Appearance 89 (Signpost) is what the original permanent placement used as an instance override; the plc_placard6 blueprint default (135) is a small merchant's placard and is the wrong prop."
  },
